```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant App
    participant OS (File System)
    participant EBS Volume
    participant S3 (Snapshots)
    
    App->>OS (File System): Write File
    OS (File System)->>EBS Volume: Block Level Write
    
    Note over EBS Volume,S3: Nightly DLM Policy triggers
    EBS Volume->>S3: Identify changed blocks
    EBS Volume->>S3: Copy changed blocks (Incremental)
    S3-->>EBS Volume: Snapshot ID returned
```
